fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"coretracers/leaks.html#tracer-leaks:check-refs","fragment":"\n\tcheck-refs\n\nWhether to record every location where a leaked object was reffed and unreffed.\nWhen enabled, the tracer will collect stack traces for every ref/unref operation\non tracked objects.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct Only\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tfalse\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});